OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785844078
OL,3,COutbreak of Bluetongue threatens
OL,4,Clivestock
OL,6,FCheryl Cottle-Hunkin runs a family
OL,7,Ffarm in Petrockstowe in North Devon
OL,8,Fand many of her animals have been
OL,9,Fshowing signs of the virus.
OL,11,F"They're just looking depressed, got
OL,12,Ftheir heads down, not eating. In the
OL,13,Fbeginning they didn't have any
OL,14,Fsymptoms at all, we were just finding
OL,15,Fthem dropped down dead in the field.
OL,16,FWe didn't know what was causing it, we
OL,17,Fdidn't know if they had been poisoned.
OL,19,F"It's heartbreaking seeing your
OL,20,Fanimals die in front of you".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785844078
OL,3,COutbreak of Bluetongue threatens
OL,4,Clivestock
OL,6,FAccording to the official stats, there
OL,7,Fwere 92 cases reported across England
OL,8,Fsince the start of July, but Cheryl
OL,9,Ffears the true number could be much
OL,10,Fhigher.
OL,12,FAdrian Parsons is a farmer near
OL,13,FLaunceston in Cornwall - he has lost
OL,14,Fsix ewes and two rams to the virus,
OL,15,Fand worries it may soon grow out of
OL,16,Fcontrol.
OL,18,F"The vaccine hasn't been taken up like
OL,19,Fit could have been - knowing what we
OL,20,Fknow, perhaps we should have seen
OL,21,Fnational vaccination at farm level".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785844078
OL,3,COutbreak of Bluetongue threatens
OL,4,Clivestock
OL,6,FThe recent dry, hot weather is thought
OL,7,Fto have caused a rise in cases of the
OL,8,Fdisease.
OL,10,FIan May is the South West regional
OL,11,Fmanager for the National Sheep
OL,12,FAssociation, which is supporting
OL,13,Ffarmers where it can.
OL,15,F"It impacts people's mental health but
OL,16,Fit's also the economic (impact) -
OL,17,Fvaccinating, time spent managing the
OL,18,Fsheep is all an extra burden on the
OL,19,Fday-to-day job."
OL,26,@xD@XpmxD@_pn
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785844078
OL,3,COutbreak of Bluetongue threatens
OL,4,Clivestock
OL,6,FThe vaccination takes around 30 days
OL,7,Fto take effect.
OL,9,FMr May continues: "We're always
OL,10,Fbringing in new ewes into the flock -
OL,11,Fif we're losing viable mothers, that's
OL,12,Fanother burden, and it's also making
OL,13,Fus think about the impact of livestock
OL,14,Fsales in the autumn".
OL,16,FHe adds: "In the long-term, we're
OL,17,Fgoing to need to keep an eye on
OL,18,FBluetongue as it becomes endemic in
OL,19,Fthe country".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
