OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785844078
OL,3,COutbreak of Bluetongue threatens
OL,4,Clivestock
OL,6,FThe Animal and Plant Health Agency
OL,7,Fsays farmers should remain vigilant
OL,8,Fand report any symptoms of the virus.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
